          "explanationUz": "Har bir bo'shliqda BIRINCHI HARF va HARFLAR SONI berilgan.\nBu — kitobning yordami: masalan 'w________' = w + 8 ta harf = 9 harfli so'z.\n\nBarcha sifatlar Coursebook 19-betdan olingan:\n  wonderful, double, modern, spacious, lovely,\n  comfortable, quiet, large\n\nSifat + ot birikmalari:\n  a wonderful view       — ajoyib manzara\n  a double garage        — ikki mashinalik garaj\n  a modern flat          — zamonaviy kvartira\n  a spacious living-room — keng mehmonxona\n  a lovely view          — go'zal manzara\n  a comfortable armchair — qulay kreslo\n  a quiet street         — tinch ko'cha\n  a large swimming-pool  — katta basseyn",
          "bookRef": "Workbook, 12-bet, 2-mashq",
          "items": [
            { "textEn": "1  The flat has got a w________ view.", "answer": "wonderful", "whyUz": "w + 8 harf = wonderful (ajoyib). 'a wonderful view' — Coursebook 19-betdagi birikma." },
            { "textEn": "2  There is a d_____ garage. You can park two cars there.", "answer": "double", "whyUz": "d + 5 harf = double. 'Two cars' — demak ikki mashinalik garaj." },
            { "textEn": "3  This m_____ flat has got a s_______ living-room. (1-bo'shliq)", "answer": "modern", "whyUz": "m + 5 harf = modern (zamonaviy)." },
            { "textEn": "3  This modern flat has got a s_______ living-room. (2-bo'shliq)", "answer": "spacious", "whyUz": "s + 7 harf = spacious (keng)." },
            { "textEn": "4  My bedroom has got a balcony with a l_____ view.", "answer": "lovely", "whyUz": "l + 5 harf = lovely (go'zal, yoqimli)." },
            { "textEn": "5  There are two c__________ armchairs in the living-room.", "answer": "comfortable", "whyUz": "c + 10 harf = comfortable (qulay). O'qilishi 'KAMftabl'." },
            { "textEn": "6  The house is in a q____ street far from the city centre.", "answer": "quiet", "whyUz": "q + 4 harf = quiet (tinch). Markazdan uzoq — shovqinsiz." },
            { "textEn": "7  My house has got a beautiful garden with a l____ swimming-pool.", "answer": "large", "whyUz": "l + 4 harf = large (katta). 'big' 3 harf — mos kelmaydi." }
          ]
        }
